{"id": "lalat", "fps": 30, "duration": 60.432, "audio": "voiceover/lalat/full.mp3", "estimate": false, "scenes": [{"id": "l1-hook", "text": "Di mata lalat, tangan lo literally slow motion.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.784}, {"id": "l2-tim", "text": "Jadi lo tim nepok pake tangan, atau tim raket nyamuk? Spill di komen, ntar kita buktiin.", "start": 3.784, "end": 10.156}, {"id": "l3-relate", "text": "Tiga kali nepok. Miss semua. Dan honestly? Itu bukan skill issue lo kok.", "start": 10.156, "end": 16.296}, {"id": "l4-mata", "text": "Mata lalat tuh isinya ribuan lensa kecil, which is dia bisa nge-scan hampir ke segala arah. Even ke belakang.", "start": 16.296, "end": 23.088}, {"id": "l5-250", "text": "Mata kita nangkep sekitar 60 kedipan per detik. Lalat? 250. Empat kali lipat, gila sih.", "start": 23.088, "end": 31.887}, {"id": "l6-pov", "text": "Jadi pas lo ngayun tangan, buat dia tuh kayak nonton video yang di-slow. Santai banget, you know.", "start": 31.887, "end": 38.329}, {"id": "l7-kabur", "text": "Terus, dalam sepersepuluh detik, dia udah nge-plan rute kabur. Arah lompatnya pun udah diitung. Kayak... se-niat itu.", "start": 38.329, "end": 46.918}, {"id": "l8-tips", "text": "Triknya? Jangan target tempat dia diem. Arahin dikit ke depannya, ke tempat dia bakal lompat. Make sense kan?", "start": 46.918, "end": 54.129}, {"id": "l9-mvp", "text": "Tapi jujurly, menurut gue raket nyamuk tetep the real MVP. Soalnya...", "start": 54.129, "end": 60.432}], "captions": [{"w": "Di", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.143, "scene": 0}, {"w": "mata", "s": 0.179, "e": 0.357, "scene": 0}, {"w": "lalat,", "s": 0.429, "e": 1.071, "scene": 0}, {"w": "tangan", "s": 1.107, "e": 1.429, "scene": 0}, {"w": "lo", "s": 1.536, "e": 1.643, "scene": 0}, {"w": "literally", "s": 1.786, "e": 2.357, "scene": 0}, {"w": "slow", "s": 2.429, "e": 2.643, "scene": 0}, {"w": "motion.", "s": 2.714, "e": 3.357, "scene": 0}, {"w": "Jadi", "s": 3.784, "e": 4.141, "scene": 1}, {"w": "lo", "s": 4.212, "e": 4.355, "scene": 1}, {"